# Content & i18n

## Dictionaries

- `Dictionary` in `types.ts` is the contract; `en.ts` and `fr.ts` must satisfy it fully
- Add keys to `types.ts` first when inventing new copy shapes
- Keep wording out of components - export slices via `getDictionary`

## Menu

- Add `ItemId`, then category row, then both dictionary `items` entries
- Use `cake()` / `cupcake()` helpers for size/dozen pricing patterns
- Units via `UnitKey` + `formatPrice` - French comma decimal and trailing ` $` are automatic

## Site & photos

- Real-world contact changes only in `site.ts`
- New images: optimise → `public/photos/` → key in `photos.ts` → alt in both dictionaries

## Locales

- Extend `locales` in `i18n.ts` and register the dictionary in `dictionaries/index.ts` for a new language
